From: Qore Technologies <info@qore.org>
Subject: [PATCH] v8: terminate invalid bounded allocator status values

Copyright 2026 Qore Technologies, s.r.o.

AllocationStatus has a fixed int underlying type. Values outside the named
enumerators must not fall through a non-void function. Use V8's existing
fatal unreachable path and retain exhaustive switch diagnostics for additions.

--- a/deps/v8/src/base/bounded-page-allocator.cc
+++ b/deps/v8/src/base/bounded-page-allocator.cc
@@ -271,6 +271,7 @@ const char* BoundedPageAllocator::AllocationStatusToString(
     case AllocationStatus::kHintedAddressTakenOrNotFound:
       return "Hinted address was taken or not found";
   }
+  UNREACHABLE();
 }
 
 }  // namespace base
